  "bug_description": "### 🐛 Describe the bug\n\nI found the _compiled_create_block_mask is never used created by here:\nhttps://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/blob/main/torch/distributed/tensor/experimental/_context_parallel/_attention.py#L1035\nI don't know what this line of code does. \nThe global code will call torch.compile and call \n```torch.distributions.Distribution.set_default_validate_args(False)``` from here https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/blob/main/torch/_dynamo/eval_frame.py#L2366\nThis may affect the use of distribution ops.\n\n### Versions\n\nmaster\n\ncc @H-Huang @awgu @wanchaol @fegin @fduwjj @wz337 @wconstab @d4l3k @pragupta @msaroufim @dcci @chauhang @penguinwu @Chillee @drisspg @yanboliang @BoyuanFeng",
